# SpecSelf Starter — keep your life yours.
#
# By default we ignore ALL personal content under your-life/ and commit only the
# structure (READMEs and .gitkeep files). This lets you publish/fork the kit
# without leaking your corpus. If you keep your whole life in a PRIVATE repo and
# WANT it versioned, delete the your-life/ rules below — but read
# steering/privacy.md first.

# --- Personal content (default: not committed) ---
your-life/**
!your-life/
!your-life/**/
!your-life/**/README.md
!your-life/**/.gitkeep
!your-life/README.md

# --- The escape hatch is NEVER committed, no exceptions ---
**/.sensitive/
.sensitive/

# --- Generated context bundle (contains your corpus; never commit) ---
context-bundle.md

# --- Local agent / tooling noise ---
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
